OL,3,GNEWSANo further action over MP's
OL,4,A'racial slur' post on X
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Essex MP will face no further action
OL,7,Fover an online post that led to a Sky
OL,8,FNews journalist being racially abused.
OL,10,FJames McMurdock was accused of starting
OL,11,Fa chain of posts on X that spelled out
OL,12,Fa racial slur against political
OL,13,Freporter Mhari Aurora in August 2025.
OL,15,FThe Standards Committee found he did
OL,16,Fnot breach parliamentary rules, but it
OL,17,Frejected his claim that posting the
OL,18,Fletter "N" was accidental and it said
OL,19,Fhe had "started a racial slur online".
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,376,370,200,160,0,100
