OL,3,GNEWSANo further action over MP's
OL,4,A'racial slur' post on X
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcMurdock, who represents South
OL,7,FBasildon and East Thurrock as an
OL,8,Findependent MP, branded the
OL,9,Finvestigation a "ridiculous waste of
OL,10,Ftaxpayers' money".
